NOTICE -- Prior art and acknowledgements

This project builds directly on the format research, reverse engineering, and
reference implementation published in:

    jwheare/mythextract
    https://github.com/jwheare/mythextract
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 James Wheare

mythextract is the source of our understanding of the Myth TFL and Myth II
monolith container layout, the TFL and SB tag header structures, the TFL-to-SB
tag header conversion, and the written format notes in its `docs/` directory.
Any code in this repository that is derived from or closely follows mythextract
remains subject to its MIT license, reproduced in substance above, and is
credited in-place at the relevant source files.

mythextract is not vendored or redistributed here. It is cloned into a
git-ignored `reference/` directory for study only.

